    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "since 3.5, replacement <a href=\"../../core/dialect/DialectResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver</code></a> was moved to\n            the <a href=\"../../core/dialect/package-summary.html\"><code>org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect</code></a> package.",
      "translation": "自 3.5 版本起，替换的<a href=\"../../core/dialect/DialectResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver</code></a>已移至<a href=\"../../core/dialect/package-summary.html\"><code>org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.dialect</code></a>包中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieve a <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> by inspecting a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过检查<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>接口来获取一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>. Resolution typically uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/JdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcOperations</code></a> to obtain and inspect a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>. Dialect resolution uses Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>spring.factories</code></a> to determine\navailable <a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>extensions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析一个<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>。解析过程通常使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/JdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcOperations</code></a>来获取并检查一个\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection</code></a>。Dialect 解析使用 Spring 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>spring.factories</code></a>来确定可用的\n<a href=\"DialectResolver.JdbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>extensions</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the resolved <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> <a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>DialectResolver.NoDialectException</code></a> if the database type cannot be determined from\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "抛出已解析的<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\"><code>DialectResolver.NoDialectException</code></a>，如果无法从<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>确定数据库类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\">DialectResolver.NoDialectException</a></code> - if no <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a> can be found.",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.repository.config\">DialectResolver.NoDialectException</a></code> - 如果找不到任何 <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
